{title: Double Portion}
{subtitle: 1 Kings 19:19–21; 2 Kings 2:9–14; 5:1–14; 4:1–7; 4:32–37; 6:13–23}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 85}
{time: 2/4}

{comment: Intro}
